        "original_id": "ccd26651-81bd-50d7-afc0-a363fe8f7103",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dana Carvey, Chris Farley, Rob Lowe, Tia Carrere, Lara Flynn Boyle, Brian Doyle-Murray, Ed O'Neill, Ione Skye, Meat Loaf, Alice Cooper\n- Works: Wayne's World, Wayne's World 2, Saturday Night Live\n- Organizations: Chicago's Second City Theatre, NBC\n- Roles: Garth Algar\n\nFacts:\n- Dana Thomas Carvey was born on June 2, 1955.\n- Dana Carvey was a cast member of NBC's Saturday Night Live from 1986 to 1993.\n- Chris Farley was a member of Chicago's Second City Theatre before joining NBC's Saturday Night Live.\n- Chris Farley was a cast member of NBC's Saturday Night Live from 1990 to 1995.\n- Dana Carvey played Garth Algar in Wayne's World in 1992.\n- Wayne's World also features Rob Lowe, Tia Carrere, Lara Flynn Boyle, Brian Doyle-Murray, Chris Farley, Ed O'Neill, Ione Skye, Meat Loaf, and Alice Cooper.\n- Dana Carvey reprised Garth Algar in Wayne's World 2 in 1993.\n- Chris Farley was known for his loud, energetic comedic style.",
